```gitignore
# ============================================================
# .gitignore - AXNN (AXN Note) v1.1.0
# Berlaku untuk semua tim (A, B, C, D, E)
# Jangan hapus atau modifikasi tanpa persetujuan Tim A
# ============================================================

# -------------------- PYTHON --------------------
# Byte-compiled / optimized / DLL files
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
*.pyd
*.pyo

# Distribution / packaging
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
share/python-wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
MANIFEST

# PyInstaller
*.spec
*.manifest
*.exe
*.app

# Installer logs
pip-log.txt
pip-delete-this-directory.txt

# Unit test / coverage reports
htmlcov/
.tox/
.nox/
.coverage
.coverage.*
.cache
nosetests.xml
coverage.xml
*.cover
*.py,cover
.hypothesis/
.pytest_cache/
cover/
tests/__pycache__/

# MyPy
.mypy_cache/
.dmypy.json
dmypy.json

# Pyre type checker
.pyre/

# pytype static type analyzer
.pytype/

# Cython debug symbols
cython_debug/

# -------------------- BUILD & ANDROID --------------------
# Buildozer
.buildozer/
buildozer.spec.backup
*.buildozer.log

# Android build artifacts
*.apk
*.aab
*.ap_
*.dex
*.jar
*.class
gen/
obj/
bin/
libs/
assets/
res/
AndroidManifest.xml
local.properties
gradle/
gradlew
gradlew.bat
*.keystore
*.jks
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.csr
*.p12
*.pfx

# Android Studio / IDE
*.iml
.idea/
.gradle/
build/
captures/
.externalNativeBuild/
.cxx/
*.hprof
*.iws
*.ipr
*.swp
*.swo

# -------------------- KIVY --------------------
# Kivy cache
*.kivy
*.kivy.log
kivy_venv/
kivy_env/

# -------------------- DATABASE --------------------
# SQLite
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db-journal

# Database backups
*.sql
*.sql.bak

# -------------------- IDE & EDITOR --------------------
# VS Code
.vscode/
*.code-workspace
.vscode-test/

# Vim
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.*.swp
.*.swo

# Emacs
*~
\#*\#
.\#*

# Sublime Text
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace
*.sublime-settings

# IntelliJ / PyCharm
.idea/
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr
out/
.idea_modules/

# Eclipse
.project
.classpath
.settings/
*.prefs

# -------------------- OS GENERATED --------------------
# macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Windows
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.cab
*.msi
*.msm
*.msp

# Linux
.directory
*.pid
*.lock
*.log

# -------------------- BACKUP FILES --------------------
*.bak
*.backup
*.old
*.orig
*.tmp
*.temp
*.cache
*.lck

# -------------------- ENVIRONMENT & SECRETS --------------------
# Python virtual environment
venv/
env/
ENV/
.env
.venv
virtualenv/
pyenv/
.python-version
.venv.bak/
env.bak/

# Secrets & credentials
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.csr
secret*.txt
*.p12
*.pfx
.credentials
.secrets
*.secret

# Configuration files (local)
config.ini
*.conf
settings.ini
local_settings.py
*.local.py

# -------------------- LOGS & TEMP --------------------
# Log files
*.log
logs/
log/
crash/
crash.log
error.log
debug.log

# Temporary files
tmp/
temp/
*.tmp
*.temp
*.cache
*.lck
*.pid

# Crash dumps
*.crash
*.dump
*.dmp
crashlytics/

# -------------------- DATA (User files) --------------------
# User data - ignore all except sample files
data/*.db
data/*.sqlite
data/*.sqlite3
data/user_data/
data/backup/
data/export/
data/temp/
data/*.json
!data/sample_data.json
!data/code_templates.json

# -------------------- DOCUMENTATION BUILD --------------------
docs/_build/
docs/api/
docs/html/
docs/latex/
docs/_static/
docs/_templates/
docs/doctrees/
docs/.buildinfo

# -------------------- NOTEBOOKS --------------------
# Jupyter Notebooks
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.ipynb_checkpoints
*.nbconvert.ipynb
*.nbconvert.html
*.nbconvert.pdf

# Colab
*.colab.ipynb
!notebooks/build_axnn_colab.ipynb

# -------------------- PACKAGE MANAGERS --------------------
# pip
pip-log.txt
pip-delete-this-directory.txt
pip-wheel-metadata/
share/python-wheels/
*.whl

# setuptools
*.egg-info/
*.egg
MANIFEST
dist/
build/

# Poetry
poetry.lock
poetry.toml

# Pipenv
Pipfile.lock

# PDM
.pdm.toml
__pypackages__/

# -------------------- CI/CD --------------------
# GitHub Actions (keep template, ignore outputs)
.github/actions/
.github/workflows/*.yml
!.github/workflows/ci.yml
*.ci.log
*.workflow.log

# -------------------- TEMPORARY PROJECT FILES --------------------
# Build artifacts
*.build.log
*.error.log
*.test.log
*.coverage.*

# Project specific
*.axnn.*
*.axnn.bak
*.axnn.tmp

# -------------------- BIN & OUTPUT --------------------
# Binary output
bin/
!bin/.gitkeep
*.apk
*.aab
*.ipa
*.deb
*.rpm
*.dmg
*.pkg
*.msi
*.exe

# -------------------- MISC --------------------
# macOS metadata
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*

# Thumbnails
Thumbs.db
thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Archives (keep sample)
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.rar
*.7z
*.bz2
*.xz
!data/*.json  # Already handled above

# -------------------- KIVY SPECIFIC --------------------
# Kivy garden
garden/
kivy_venv/

# Kivy atlas
*.atlas
*.atlas.png

# Buildozer cache
.buildozer/
.android/
.venv_buildozer/

# -------------------- VERSION CONTROL --------------------
# Git
*.orig
*.mine
*.BASE
*.REMOTE
*.LOCAL
*.diff
*.patch

# -------------------- EXAMPLES & TEMPLATES --------------------
# Sample files that should NOT be ignored
# These will be tracked
!data/sample_data.json
!data/code_templates.json
!assets/icon.png
!assets/splash.png
!notebooks/build_axnn_colab.ipynb
!.github/workflows/ci.yml

# -------------------- IGNORE BUT KEEP STRUCTURE --------------------
# Keep empty directories via .gitkeep
!bin/.gitkeep
!logs/.gitkeep
!tmp/.gitkeep

# ============================================================
# AKHIR .gitignore - AXNN v1.1.0
# ============================================================
```

---

📋 Ringkasan File .gitignore

File .gitignore ini dirancang untuk AXNN v1.1.0 dan mencakup:

1. Python & Build

Kategori File/folder yang diabaikan
Python cache __pycache__/, *.pyc, *.pyo
Build artifacts build/, dist/, *.egg-info/
Virtual env venv/, env/, .env
Test coverage .coverage, htmlcov/, .pytest_cache/

2. Android & Buildozer

Kategori File/folder yang diabaikan
Buildozer .buildozer/, buildozer.spec.backup
APK/AAB *.apk, *.aab
Android keystore *.keystore, *.jks, *.pem, *.key
Gradle gradle/, .gradle/, *.iml

3. Database & Data

Kategori File/folder yang diabaikan
SQLite *.db, *.sqlite, *.sqlite3
User data data/*.db, data/user_data/, data/*.json
Pengecualian !data/sample_data.json, !data/code_templates.json

4. IDE & OS

Kategori File/folder yang diabaikan
VS Code .vscode/
PyCharm .idea/, *.iml
Vim/Emacs *.swp, *~, \#*\#
macOS .DS_Store, ._*
Windows Thumbs.db, Desktop.ini

5. Editor Kode (Tim D)

Kategori File/folder yang diabaikan
Temporary files *.tmp, *.temp, *.cache
Editor backups *.bak, *.backup, *.old
Kivy garden garden/, *.atlas

6. CI/CD & Notebooks

Kategori File/folder yang diabaikan
CI logs *.ci.log, *.workflow.log
Jupyter .ipynb_checkpoints/
Pengecualian !notebooks/build_axnn_colab.ipynb
Pengecualian !.github/workflows/ci.yml

```
